  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The text of this book was transposed one word at a time, in a rotating sequence, from the following ten books: 'Alice in Wonderland' by Lewis Carroll, 'Absalom, Absalom!' by William Faulkner, 'The Crying of Lot 49' by Thomas Pynchon, 'Mythodologies' by Roland Barthes, 'The Odyssey' by Homer, 'Radical Chic' by Tom Wolfe, 'The Return of the Native' by Thomas Hardy, 'Sense and Sensibilia' by J.L. Austin, 'The Temper of Our Time' by Eric Hoffer, 'Ulysses' by James Joyce - and reassembled into the grammatical form of the novella 'Sarrasine' by Honore de Balzac."</subfield>
  </datafield>
